		(uuid "696ee1e5-7035-4250-b038-2129f8aba92d")
	)
	(text "U16 isolates A1 S2 TX from CM4 GPIO13 (ROBO_RX_MCU); U19 (below the\nJ9 box) isolates CM4 GPIO12 (ROBO_TX_MCU) from A1 S1 RX and its pull-up.\nA1 runs from the battery while the CM4 can be off (SW1 open, GLOBAL_EN\npower cycle). Wired direct, A1 would back-power the CM4 through GPIO13\nor GPIO12 (abs max VREF+0.5 V). Both 74LVC1G17 run on 3V3_CM4; with it\noff, Ioff makes Y high-Z and A tolerates 3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.05 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7af8d9e9-dad1-4333-adee-572b24a8eed3")
	)
	(text "D23: Vishay SMBJ3V3-E3/52, 600 W\nSMB TVS. VBR >= 4.1 V, VC 7.3 V\n@ 50 A, IR <= 200 uA. Holds U18 OUT\n(7 V abs max) on a J9 miswire until\nF3 trips. Not a generic SMBJ3.3A:\nsome break down at 6.5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.354 153.924 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b4580f3-9ec3-450b-8b37-1aa7f8b94fa4")
	)
